Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.54,0:00:01.48,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Mergi înainte...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.91,0:00:04.95,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.43,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu voi mai fugi...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.62,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu de acum înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.37,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi întoarce!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.70,0:00:30.93,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Mergi înainte...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.52,0:00:42.02,Italics,G,0,0,0,,cu toată puterea mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.19,0:00:53.61,Dialogue,Til,0,0,0,,Știam că poți face asta dacă încerci, frate.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.19,0:00:59.62,Dialogue,Til,0,0,0,,Aș fi vrut să te fi putut vedea făcând mai multe.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.95,0:01:07.71,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Til! Til! Til!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.94,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Jur că nu voi mai fugi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.08,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi întoarce.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.27,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi opri.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.27,0:01:17.03,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă mi se rup picioarele, chiar dacă nu mai pot vedea,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,voi continua să alerg înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.63,0:01:22.98,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Și tu mă vei privi de undeva,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.02,Italics,,0,0,0,,nu-i așa, Til?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.10,0:01:28.98,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Și astfel am început să alerg spre centrul lumii.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.50,0:03:04.11,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,Continentul Consume, un ținut unde războiul nu se oprește niciodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.68,0:03:08.08,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,Acolo, Regatul Segua cu ochi albaștri
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.57,Italics,,0,0,0,,și Imperiul Ninteldo cu ochi roșii
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.57,0:03:14.19,Italics,,0,0,0,,luptau pentru controlul ținutului.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.75,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,Dar în ultimii câțiva ani,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.75,Italics,,0,0,0,,odată cu ascensiunea Împăratului Marcus,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.75,0:03:20.29,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,forțele Ninteldo au crescut rapid în putere,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.29,0:03:25.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,iar ei și aliații lor controlau 90% din continent.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.03,0:03:29.02,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,Regatul Segua pierdea războiul.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.98,0:03:34.98,Title,Narr,0,0,0,,Războaiele Dure ale lui Consume
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.87,0:03:41.00,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Am reușit în sfârșit, Til.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.03,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Vicegeneral Ramses!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.96,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Vorbești foarte tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.89,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,M-Mă scuzați, Vicegeneral Ramses.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.87,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Un bărbat ciudat cere să fie primit în armată.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.65,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Cine?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.65,0:03:56.13,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Cu siguranță este un seguian, dar nu știu nimic despre el...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.34,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Spune că îl cheamă Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.01,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.37,0:04:06.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Deci tu ești cel care vrea să intre în armata noastră, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.77,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Ăă, vreau să intru în armata Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.13,0:04:10.93,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Vă rog!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.55,0:04:14.46,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Știam eu. El este...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.44,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Foarte bine, am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.66,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear, corect?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.15,0:04:23.45,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Dacă vrei să intri în armată,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.45,0:04:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,trebuie să lupți aici și să-ți dovedești puterea.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.39,0:04:28.94,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Luptă cu toți cei de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.66,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,D-Dar asta e nebunie!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.55,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Nu te mulțumește asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.55,0:04:35.28,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu, am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.57,0:04:39.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Aici sunt 50 dintre cei mai buni oameni ai armatei regulate.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum arată-mi Killer Power-ul tău!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.11,0:04:44.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Începeți!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.49,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Uau!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.57,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,S-a mișcat atât de repede!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.57,0:04:57.48,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Ai văzut asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.94,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Ce a fost asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.44,0:05:05.29,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu voi mai fugi. Voi merge înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.12,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Îmi voi dovedi puterea!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.80,Italics,R,0,0,0,,I-a doborât pe toți?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.30,Italics,,0,0,0,,În doar câteva minute?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.30,0:05:17.12,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Este cu mult peste ce mi-am imaginat!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.42,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Oprește-te chiar acolo, puștiule.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.41,0:05:21.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Încă nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,E încă prea devreme să devii arogant.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.63,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Cel mai puternic om din armata Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.96,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Harris, Căpitanul Apărării.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.96,0:05:32.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Ești rapid, recunosc asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.81,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Dar ai și putere?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.41,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Asta e!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.28,Italics,R,0,0,0,,El este cel pe care l-am așteptat!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.29,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Cu el aici, pot face asta să devină realitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.76,Italics,R,0,0,0,,O nouă eră pentru Segua!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.13,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,A fost grozav, frate!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.59,0:06:07.64,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Pot recupera partea noastră din Consume de la Ninteldo
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.64,Italics,,0,0,0,,și pot pune capăt Războaielor Dure!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.22,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.22,0:06:27.40,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Jucători ca tine nu știu nimic!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.48,0:06:32.41,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Aici, în Consume...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.89,0:06:38.09,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,lucrurile nu funcționează așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.32,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,S-a terminat.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.76,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Toți vorbeau despre cât de grozave
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.76,0:07:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,erau specificațiile lor înainte să apară cu adevărat,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.82,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,dar erau de tot rahatul.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.47,0:07:19.36,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Nu mai există nimeni în Consume care să ne poată ține piept.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.36,0:07:22.16,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Se pare că nu a mai rămas decât Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.16,0:07:24.84,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Am auzit zvonuri că vor încerca ceva în curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.50,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Segua?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.04,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Nu contează ce face Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.95,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Ninteldo are un singur scop.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.10,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Și cred că
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.79,0:07:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cerul ne-a încredințat acest scop.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.29,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ca să fiu sincer, lucrurile nu arată bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.29,0:07:50.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ninteldo și aliații săi controlează 90% din continent.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.67,0:07:53.86,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Dar următoarea operațiune este începutul contraatacului nostru.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.59,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ținta noastră este Fortăreața Speranței,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.59,0:07:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dintr-una dintre țările aliate cu Ninteldo, „Tetrand”.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.03,0:08:03.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Îl vom salva pe Generalul Alex, care este ținut acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.63,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear, te pun la conducere
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a primei echipe de forțe speciale pentru misiune.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.30,0:08:14.13,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Totul se întâmplă puțin cam repede...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.54,0:08:17.27,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Este cea mai importantă sarcină din operațiunea care urmează.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Nu este suficient?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.47,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu, e mai mult decât suficient.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.47,0:08:23.39,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Poți să-i bați pe oamenii ăia din Ninteldo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.61,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Ești grozav!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.61,0:08:26.86,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Dă-le bătaie!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.19,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Să dăm tot ce putem în următoarea operațiune.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.72,0:08:33.85,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Nu știam că Segua mai are războinici ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Unde ai fost?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.62,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.73,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ce faci—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.73,0:08:50.51,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Doar salutam.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.58,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Priveam de sus.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.47,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Îl pui în echipa de forțe speciale?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Aceasta este Opal,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.48,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,una dintre forțele speciale, la fel ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Este a doua cea mai puternică din armata Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Generalul Alex este cel mai puternic,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.97,0:09:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar a fost capturat de inamic.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.89,0:09:17.49,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Așa că, momentan, ea este cea mai puternică pe care o avem în armată.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.31,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.30,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Îmi pare bine să te cunosc.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.30,0:09:22.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,S-Sunt Nel!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.50,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,P-Pentru azi ar trebui să te odihnești.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.04,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Voi pregăti o cameră.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Putem discuta detaliile mâine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.88,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,E atât de moale!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.88,0:09:37.51,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,N-am mai dormit într-un pat ca acesta de o veșnicie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.67,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,O scrisoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.35,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Da, așa pare.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.56,0:09:47.87,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Sunt obosit.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.87,0:09:49.12,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Hai să ne culcăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.12,0:09:49.84,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.53,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Ce vrei?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.12,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,M-ai chemat la ora asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.12,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Sunt uimit că nu ai fugit.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.75,0:10:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O să fiu directă cu tine: nu te plac!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.60,0:10:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să lupt în forțele speciale alături de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luptă cu mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.57,0:10:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă câștigi, voi face orice vrei.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă eu câștig...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleci din castel!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.56,0:10:28.73,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Bine, dacă asta e ceea ce trebuie să fac ca să te mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.27,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Asta este atitudinea pe care o urăsc!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.27,0:10:35.40,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Crezi că dacă arăți cât de puternic ești, totul va merge după cum vrei tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Îți place să-i bați pe cei mai slabi decât tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.94,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,La fel ca el...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.49,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Urăsc mai mult decât orice bărbații ca tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ți-am văzut puterea mai devreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.75,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Nu ar fi corect dacă nu ți-aș arăta-o pe a mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.01,0:10:51.90,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Aruncă piatra aceea în mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.18,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.01,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.48,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Indiferent cât de rapid ești,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.60,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Nu voi rata niciodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.89,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Nu sunt suficient de proastă încât să ucid un alt seguian.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Cine dă primul lovitura adevărată câștigă.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.99,0:11:12.88,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.81,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.52,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Atunci să începem.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.36,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Când această pietricică atinge pământul, începem.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.59,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.40,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Am câștigat.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.40,0:11:26.83,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Victoria mea este deja asigurată!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.83,0:11:30.00,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Probabil va ocoli ca să evite săgeata,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.00,0:11:33.28,Italics,O,0,0,0,,dar trebuie să se apropie pentru a ataca.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.90,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Va sări spre mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.63,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Iar când o va face, este al meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.72,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Ești doar un barbar.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.39,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Nu mă poți învinge.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.39,0:11:47.31,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Spre deosebire de tine, eu am luptat ani și ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.31,0:11:50.39,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ești doar un șobolan arogant coborât din munți!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.00,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Iar aroganța asta se termină aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.48,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Vine direct spre mine și este rapid!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.16,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Oh, ești treaz?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.66,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ce faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.00,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă jos!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.58,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Erai leșinat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\a6}Dă-mi drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.58,0:12:19.17,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu puteam să te las afară pe plajă noaptea.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.49,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Poate toată lumea crede că sunt plin de mine
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,pentru că i-am învins,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.79,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,dar nu este adevărat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.89,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Voiam doar ca toți să mă accepte,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.89,0:12:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și să o ajut pe Segua cât de repede puteam.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.19,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate. Până de curând m-am ascuns în munți.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.77,0:12:38.15,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu încercam să merg înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.35,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu mi-am dat seama cât de prost eram.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.53,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Până când a murit cel mai bun prieten al meu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.32,0:12:49.37,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Voi luptați de ani de zile, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.78,0:12:52.02,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Așa că vă respect pe toți...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.48,0:12:57.18,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Pe toți cei care deja mergeați înainte
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cu ani înaintea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.81,0:13:02.50,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Cred că nu e chiar atât de rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.50,0:13:04.73,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Este doar foarte direct.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.43,0:13:07.59,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Va trebui să-mi cer scuze mai târziu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.91,0:13:19.23,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,De aici e suficient.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.02,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Pot merge pe jos restul drumului.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.35,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Deci, ce ar trebui să fac?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.35,0:13:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.33,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ei bine... știi...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.97,0:13:34.30,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Am spus că dacă ai câștiga, aș face orice...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.73,0:13:36.96,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Asta e rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.96,0:13:40.94,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Eram atât de sigură că nu voi pierde, încât m-am lăsat dusă de val!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.22,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Dar aceea nu a fost cu adevărat victoria mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.79,0:13:53.57,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Ai ezitat pentru că săgeata aceea
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.57,0:13:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,m-ar fi lovit drept în cap, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.98,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,M-am gândit că ești mult mai drăguț
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,decât păreai.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.73,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,O înfrângere este o înfrângere!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.28,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Dă-mi odată ordinul!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.30,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Bine, am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.29,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.86,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,De acum înainte să luptăm împreună, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.82,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.14,0:14:31.64,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Domnule Ramses, când începe misiunea forțelor speciale?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.46,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Noi doi o vom duce la îndeplinire perfect!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.11,0:14:37.53,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Putem reuși!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă Gear și cu mine lucrăm împreună,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și rotițele se îmbină...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.40,0:14:44.39,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Nu a fost hilar?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.39,0:14:45.45,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu, n-a fost.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.45,0:14:48.37,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că voi doi sunteți acum prieteni.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.37,0:14:51.72,Italics,R,0,0,0,,De ce sunt cei doi prieteni dintr-odată?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.36,0:14:55.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,V-am chemat aici să vă prezint
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.34,0:14:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,celălalt membru al forțelor speciale.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.11,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Celălalt membru?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.58,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Este cineva pe care îl cunosc?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.83,0:15:04.83,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Nu, nu este seguian.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.04,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Deci este mercenar?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.78,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ai plătit bani ca să-l angajezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.78,0:15:09.59,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.92,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Chiar va fi în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.89,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Da. Am încredere în abilitățile lui.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.36,0:15:18.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Nu există războinici care să se poată compara
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cu voi doi în Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Îl cheamă Tejirof.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.41,0:15:26.98,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,A fost colegul meu mai mare la Academia de Magie Puzzle.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.49,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Cum este?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.49,0:15:31.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Cred că cel mai potrivit cuvânt ar fi „geniu”.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.81,0:15:36.99,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Un geniu al teoriei.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.47,0:15:40.73,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Un geniu al teoriei?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Va ajunge curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.06,0:15:46.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să ajungă în aproximativ cinci minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.34,0:15:47.73,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Pare genul de tip
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,care ar apărea exact la timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.26,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Abia aștept să-l cunosc.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.27,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu întârzie?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.85,0:16:06.27,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,E ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.69,0:16:09.21,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu este tocmai cel mai bun început.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.14,0:16:10.94,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,A sosit.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Oh, salut.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.23,0:16:18.45,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Eram ocupat să mă satisfac, de aceea am întârziat.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.33,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ramses, a trecut ceva timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.21,0:16:33.79,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ești la fel de sexy ca întotdeauna.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.79,0:16:35.39,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă să ți-o bag mai târziu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Du-te și stai jos.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.95,0:16:41.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Am auzit că lucrurile stau prost pentru că generalul vostru a fost capturat.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.78,0:16:44.48,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.84,0:16:49.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Îmi voi băga bățul în gaura lăsată de generalul vostru.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.07,0:16:55.41,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Chiar o să funcționeze asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.49,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.01,0:17:03.27,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Înțeleg mai mult sau mai puțin situația.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.75,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Va fi greu doar cu aceștia doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.60,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Fata cu sânii mari și puștiul cel nou.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.68,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Sânii mei n-au nimic de-a face cu asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.01,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Dar fata cu urechile?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.81,0:17:17.76,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Nu, eu nu pot lupta...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.57,0:17:20.81,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ei bine, e în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.52,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Cât timp mai avem până la operațiune?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Patru zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.36,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Patru zile, hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.31,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Este suficient.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.89,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Bine, am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.13,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Vă voi antrena din greu în cele patru zile
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,până începe operațiunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.36,0:17:38.52,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Apărările tale sunt pline de găuri.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.52,0:17:41.29,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Îmi voi băga bățul peste tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.12,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.54,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Atunci să începem.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.55,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Chiar este în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.05,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Să începem cu tine, puștiule.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.81,0:17:57.05,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Crezi că sunt slab, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.86,0:17:58.55,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,E în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.80,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Mai întâi atacă-mă cât de tare poți.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.97,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Și voi întipări asta în memoria ta:
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.49,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,„Prima persoană pe care am întâlnit-o și care era mai puternică decât mine
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.49,0:18:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,era un pervers căruia îi plăceau glumele murdare.”
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.56,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Gata?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.29,0:18:15.35,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Să vedem puterea care te-a făcut să intri
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.35,0:18:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în echipa forțelor speciale chiar din prima zi!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.94,0:18:21.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Este rapid!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.87,0:18:24.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.24,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Asta îl va opri.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.32,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Frate!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.32,0:18:38.29,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,A reușit să vadă prin viteza lui Gear?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.99,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nu alergai folosindu-ți cea mai bună tehnică.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.99,0:18:47.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Poate că te simți bine alergând atât de repede cât poți,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.73,0:18:51.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,dar asta funcționează doar la prima etapă.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.46,0:18:54.55,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Dacă vrei să supraviețuiești, lasă deoparte aceste sentimente.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Înțelegi?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.75,0:19:00.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,A lupta pe câmpul de luptă înseamnă să ucizi.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.11,0:19:02.62,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nu poți lupta într-o bătălie adevărată bazându-te pe ceea ce simți.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.37,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Am pierdut.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.31,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Am pierdut complet.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.28,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Til.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.21,0:19:16.13,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Chiar sunt nedemn de respectul tău?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.77,0:19:19.51,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nu, am făcut o promisiune!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.17,0:19:23.27,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nimeni nu începe de la linia de sosire.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.45,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Am jurat să alerg până la capăt!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.19,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Indiferent de câte ori cad pe drum!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.84,0:19:40.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Ești bine, frate?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.48,0:19:41.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Frate?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.78,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Bună dimineața.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.61,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Cum ți-a plăcut prima ta bătaie?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.03,0:19:51.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sigur, ești puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.53,0:19:55.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Dar sunt mulți oameni pe câmpul de luptă care sunt mai puternici.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.62,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Îmi imaginez că vei întâlni câțiva dintre ei în timpul operațiunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.50,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ești pregătit să mergi oricum, puștiule?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.09,0:20:05.99,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sau vei renunța și te vei întoarce la antrenament?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.99,0:20:06.81,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nu,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.44,0:20:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi opri.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.24,0:20:10.26,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Mă duc.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.41,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Am decis să merg drept înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.10,0:20:15.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Fără ezitare.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.61,0:20:17.57,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.91,0:20:20.00,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Pentru prietenul tău mort?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.63,0:20:21.82,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Cum ai știut?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.86,0:20:23.81,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Am avut dreptate?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.39,0:20:26.83,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ei bine, era singura deducție logică.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.30,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Mi-am dat seama că ceva de genul acesta era
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.30,0:20:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,singura cale de a face un laș să coboare din
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,muntele pe care se ascundea.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.24,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Încerci să mergi drept înainte,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ca să recuperezi tot timpul pe care l-ai petrecut pe loc?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.35,0:20:39.51,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Destul de simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.59,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Indiferent ce spui,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi voi urma propriul drum!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.52,0:20:47.21,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nu, nu spun că este un lucru rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.21,0:20:48.39,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Cred că e în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.88,0:20:51.89,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Cred că nu este nimic în neregulă cu răspunsul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.80,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nu-mi plac oamenii care nu sunt direcți cu ceilalți.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.40,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să mergi cât de adânc poți cu asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.48,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Un băț...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.33,0:21:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu se simte bine decât dacă îl bagi drept înăuntru.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.30,0:21:05.57,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Mergi drept înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.17,0:21:09.02,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sper să-ți găsești acolo adevăratul răspuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.34,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Tejirof, îmi pare rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.42,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Am avut o impresie greșită despre tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.79,0:21:20.61,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Vreau să fiu mai puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.67,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Așa că ajută-mă să mă antrenez!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.47,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.94,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Dar mai odihnește-te puțin astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.94,0:21:30.18,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Poți citi acestea cât timp te odihnești.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:31.84,0:21:32.93,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Ce este asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.34,0:21:36.94,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Harta Fortăreței Speranței, unde mergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.33,0:21:41.19,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Era aproape de port, așa că am aruncat o privire înainte să vin aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.55,0:21:45.17,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,M-am implicat puțin prea mult și de aceea am întârziat o oră,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.45,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,dar, ei bine, nimeni nu mi-a spus să o caut.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.74,0:21:51.95,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Așadar, asta însemna să mă satisfac.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.39,0:21:54.46,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Pa.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.96,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nel, lumea este un loc mare.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.51,0:22:04.10,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Til, voi continua să alerg!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.29,0:23:28.74,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Acela a fost incidentul cunoscut drept Șocul Atarika.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.84,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,„Împușcare.”
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.80,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Nu, nu mai pot să mă abțin!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.55,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Se pare că ai talent pentru Online.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.55,0:23:35.14,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Cum ar fi că fata aceea este drăguță...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.82,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Oricum vreau să fiu puternic!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.82,0:23:39.94,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,De aceea este această operațiune atât de crudă?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:38.65,Location,Narr,0,0,0,,{\fad(485,1)}Capital of Segua, Outori
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:13.68,Location2,R,0,0,0,,{\fad(460,516)}Teritoriul Ninteldo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.90,Hour Later,N,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,521)}O oră mai târziu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.81,0:23:39.89,Title,Preview,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,973)}Episode 2 is Being Worked On Right Now!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.54,0:00:01.48,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Go forward...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.91,0:00:04.95,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.43,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I won't run away...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.62,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Not anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.37,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I won't go back!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.70,0:00:30.93,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Go forward...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.52,0:00:42.02,Italics,G,0,0,0,,with all my power!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.19,0:00:53.61,Dialogue,Til,0,0,0,,I knew that you could do \Nit if you tried, brother.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.19,0:00:59.62,Dialogue,Til,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen you do more.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.95,0:01:07.71,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Til! Til! Til!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.94,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I swear I won't run away anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.08,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I won't go back.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.27,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I won't stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.27,0:01:17.03,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Even if my legs break, \Neven if I can no longer see,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'll keep running forward.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.63,0:01:22.98,Italics,G,0,0,0,,And you'll be watching \Nme from somewhere,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.02,Italics,,0,0,0,,won't you, Til?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.10,0:01:28.98,Italics,G,0,0,0,,And so I started running to \Nthe center of the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.50,0:03:04.11,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,The continent of Consume, \Na land where war never stops.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.68,0:03:08.08,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,There, the blue-eyed Segua Kingdom
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.57,Italics,,0,0,0,,and the Red-Eyed Ninteldo Empire
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.57,0:03:14.19,Italics,,0,0,0,,struggled for control of the land.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.75,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,But for the last few years,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.75,Italics,,0,0,0,,with the ascension of Emperor Marcus,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.75,0:03:20.29,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,the forces of Ninteldo rapidly grew in power,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.29,0:03:25.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,and they and their allies \Ncontrolled 90% of the continent.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.03,0:03:29.02,Italics,Narr,0,0,0,,The Segua Kingdom was losing the war.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.98,0:03:34.98,Title,Narr,0,0,0,,The Hard Wars of Consume
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.87,0:03:41.00,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,We finally made it, Til.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.03,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Vice-General Ramses!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.96,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You're being very loud.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.89,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,M-My apologies, Vice-General Ramses.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.87,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,A strange man is asking to \Nbe let into the military.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.65,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.65,0:03:56.13,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,He's definitely a Seguaian, \Nbut I don't know about him...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.34,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,He says his name is Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.01,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.37,0:04:06.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So you're the one who wants \Nto join our army, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.77,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Um, I want to join the Segua army.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.13,0:04:10.93,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.55,0:04:14.46,Italics,R,0,0,0,,I knew it. He's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.44,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Very well, I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.66,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear, correct?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.15,0:04:23.45,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,If you want to join the army,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.45,0:04:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you must fight here and \Nprove your strength.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.39,0:04:28.94,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Fight everyone here.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.66,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,B-But that's crazy!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.55,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Does that not satisfy you?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.55,0:04:35.28,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,No, I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.57,0:04:39.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,There are 50 of the regular \Narmy's best men here.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now show me your Killer Power!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.11,0:04:44.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.49,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.57,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,He moved so fast!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.57,0:04:57.48,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Could you see that?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.94,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.44,0:05:05.29,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I won't run away anymore. \NI'll go forward!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.12,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I'll prove my power!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.80,Italics,R,0,0,0,,He wiped them all out?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.30,Italics,,0,0,0,,In just a few minutes?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.30,0:05:17.12,Italics,R,0,0,0,,He's far beyond what I imagined!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.42,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Stop right there, kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.41,0:05:21.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's still too early to get cocky.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.63,Italics,R,0,0,0,,The strongest man in the Segua army.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.96,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Harris, the Captain of Defenses.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.96,0:05:32.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're fast, I'll admit that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.81,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But do you have power?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.41,Italics,R,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.28,Italics,R,0,0,0,,He's what I've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.29,Italics,R,0,0,0,,With him here, I can make it real.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.76,Italics,R,0,0,0,,A new era for Segua!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.13,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That was great, brother!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.59,0:06:07.64,Italics,R,0,0,0,,I can take back our share \Nof Consume from Ninteldo,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.64,Italics,,0,0,0,,and end the Hard Wars!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.22,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.22,0:06:27.40,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Games like you don't know a thing!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.48,0:06:32.41,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,Here in Consume...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.89,0:06:38.09,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,things won't work that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.32,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.76,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,People kept going on about how great
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.76,0:07:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,their specs were before \Nthey actually showed up,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.82,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,but they were crap.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.47,0:07:19.36,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,There's no one left on Consume \Nwho can stand against us.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.36,0:07:22.16,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,I guess all that's left is Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.16,0:07:24.84,Dialogue,Zelig,0,0,0,,I heard rumors they're going \Nto try something soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.50,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Segua?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.04,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what Segua does.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.95,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,Ninteldo has but one goal.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.10,Dialogue,Marcus,0,0,0,,And I believe that
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.79,0:07:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,heaven has entrusted us with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.29,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,To be honest, things don't look good.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.29,0:07:50.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ninteldo and its allies control \N90% of the continent.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.67,0:07:53.86,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But the next operation is the \Nbeginning of our counterattack.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.59,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Our target is Hope Fortress,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.59,0:07:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in one of the countries allied \Nto Ninteldo, "Tetrand."
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.03,0:08:03.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We'll rescue General Alex, \Nwho's being held there.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.63,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Gear, I'm putting you in charge
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of the first special forces \Nsquad for the mission.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.30,0:08:14.13,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,This is all moving a little too fast...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.54,0:08:17.27,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's the most important task \Nin the upcoming operation.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Is that not enough?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.47,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,No, it's plenty.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.47,0:08:23.39,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You can beat up those Ninteldo guys!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.61,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,You're great!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.61,0:08:26.86,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.19,Dialogue,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Let's all do our best \Nin the next operation.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.72,0:08:33.85,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I didn't know Segua still \Nhad warriors like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.62,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.73,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.73,0:08:50.51,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Just saying hello.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.58,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I was watching from above.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.47,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,You're putting him in the \Nspecial forces squad?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is Opal,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.48,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,one of the special \Nforces, just like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,She's the second strongest \Nin the Segua army.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,General Alex is the strongest,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.97,0:09:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but he's been captured by the enemy.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.89,0:09:17.49,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So right now, she's the strongest \Nwe have in our army.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.31,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I'm Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.30,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.30,0:09:22.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I-I'm Nel!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.50,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,W-Well, for today you should rest.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.04,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'll have a room prepared.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We can go over the details tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.88,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,It's so soft!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.88,0:09:37.51,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I haven't slept in a \Nbed like this in ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.67,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.35,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks like it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.56,0:09:47.87,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.87,0:09:49.12,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Let's get to sleep.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.12,0:09:49.84,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.53,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.12,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Calling me out at this hour.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.12,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you didn't run away.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.75,0:10:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be up front with you: \NI don't like you!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.60,0:10:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight in the \Nspecial forces with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight me!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.57,0:10:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you win, I'll do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if I win...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You leave the castle!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.56,0:10:28.73,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,All right, if that's what \Nit takes to satisfy you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.27,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,That's the attitude I hate!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.27,0:10:35.40,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,You think if you show how strong you are, \Neverything will go your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,You get off on beating \Npeople weaker than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.94,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Just like him...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.49,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I hate men like you \Nmore than anything!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I saw your power back there.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.75,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,It's not fair unless I show you mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.01,0:10:51.90,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Throw that rock there at me.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.18,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.01,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.48,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,No matter how fast you are,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.60,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I'll never miss.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.89,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid enough to \Nkill another Seguaian.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Whoever lands the first \Nsolid hit wins.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.99,0:11:12.88,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.81,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.52,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.36,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,When this pebble hits \Nthe ground, we begin.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.59,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.40,Italics,O,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.40,0:11:26.83,Italics,O,0,0,0,,My victory is already assured!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.83,0:11:30.00,Italics,O,0,0,0,,He's probably going to go \Naround to dodge the arrow,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.00,0:11:33.28,Italics,O,0,0,0,,but he has to get close to attack.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.90,Italics,O,0,0,0,,He'll leap towards me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.63,Italics,O,0,0,0,,And when he does, he's mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.72,Italics,O,0,0,0,,You're just a barbarian.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.39,Italics,O,0,0,0,,You can't beat me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.39,0:11:47.31,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I've fought \Nfor years and years.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.31,0:11:50.39,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,You're just an arrogant rat who's \Ncome down from the mountains!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.00,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,And that arrogance ends here!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.48,Italics,O,0,0,0,,He's coming straight \Nat me, and he's fast!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.16,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.66,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.00,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.58,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,You were out cold.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\a6}Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.58,0:12:19.17,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave you out \Non the beach at night.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.49,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Maybe everybody thinks \NI'm full of myself
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because I beat them,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.79,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,but that's not true.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.89,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I just wanted everyone to accept me,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.89,0:12:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and to help Segua as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.19,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,You're right. I've been hiding in the \Nmountains until a short time ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.77,0:12:38.15,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to go forward.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.35,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I didn't realize how stupid I was.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.53,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Until my best friend died...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.32,0:12:49.37,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,You guys have been fighting \Nfor years, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.78,0:12:52.02,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,So I respect all of you...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.48,0:12:57.18,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,All of you that had already \Nbeen moving forward
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,years before me.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.81,0:13:02.50,Italics,O,0,0,0,,I guess he's not so bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.50,0:13:04.73,Italics,O,0,0,0,,He's just really straightforward.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.43,0:13:07.59,Italics,O,0,0,0,,I'll have to apologize later.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.91,0:13:19.23,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.02,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I can walk the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.35,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,So, what should I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.35,0:13:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.33,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Well... you know...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.97,0:13:34.30,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,I said that if you won, I'd do anything...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.73,0:13:36.96,Italics,O,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.96,0:13:40.94,Italics,O,0,0,0,,I was so sure I wouldn't lose, \NI got carried away!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.22,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,But that wasn't really my victory.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.79,0:13:53.57,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,You hesitated because that arrow
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.57,0:13:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would've hit me right \Nin the head, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.98,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I thought to myself that \Nyou were a lot nicer
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,than you looked.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.73,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,A loss is a loss!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.28,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Give me your order already!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.30,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.29,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.86,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Let's fight together from now on, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.82,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.14,0:14:31.64,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Ramses-san, when does the \Nspecial forces mission start?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.46,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,The two of us will execute it perfectly!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.11,0:14:37.53,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Gear and I work together,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the gears mesh...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.40,0:14:44.39,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Was that not hilarious?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.39,0:14:45.45,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.45,0:14:48.37,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm glad the two of \Nyou are friends now.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.37,0:14:51.72,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Why are the two of them \Nfriends all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.36,0:14:55.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I called you here to introduce
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.34,0:14:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the other member of the special forces.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.11,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Other member?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.58,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Is it somebody I know?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.83,0:15:04.83,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,No, he's not a Seguaian.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.04,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,So he's a mercenary?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.78,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,You paid money to hire him?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.78,0:15:09.59,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.92,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Will that really be okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.89,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm confident in his skills.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.36,0:15:18.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,There aren't any warriors \Nwho are a match
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for you two in Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,His name is Tejirof.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.41,0:15:26.98,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,He was my upperclassman \Nat Puzzle Magic Academy.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.49,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.49,0:15:31.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I guess the best word \Nwould be "genius."
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.81,0:15:36.99,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,A genius at theory.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.47,0:15:40.73,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,A genius at theory?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.06,0:15:46.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,He's supposed to arrive \Nin about five minutes.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.34,0:15:47.73,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,He sounds like the kind of guy
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who'd show up right on time.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.99,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.26,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet him.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.27,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Isn't he late?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.85,0:16:06.27,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.69,0:16:09.21,Italics,G,0,0,0,,This isn't exactly the best start.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.14,0:16:10.94,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.23,0:16:18.45,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I was busy pleasuring \Nmyself and so I'm late.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.33,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ramses, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.21,0:16:33.79,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You're as hot as ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.79,0:16:35.39,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Let me stick it in later.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Just go sit down.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.95,0:16:41.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I heard things are bad because \Nyour general was captured.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.78,0:16:44.48,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.84,0:16:49.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I'll plug my stick in the \Nhole left by your general.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.07,0:16:55.41,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Is this really going to work?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.49,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.01,0:17:03.27,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I more or less understand \Nthe situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.75,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,It's going to be hard \Nwith just these two.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.60,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,The girl with the big \Nrack and the new kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.68,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,My breasts don't have \Nanything to do with it!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.01,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,What about the girl with the ears?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.81,0:17:17.76,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,No, I can't fight...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.57,0:17:20.81,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.52,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,How much time do we have \Nleft until the operation?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Four days.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.36,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Four days, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.31,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,That's plenty.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.89,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.13,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I'll train you hard for the four days
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,until the operation starts.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.36,0:17:38.52,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Your defenses are full of holes.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.52,0:17:41.29,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I'll poke my stick in all over.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.12,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.54,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.55,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.05,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Let's start with you, new kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.81,0:17:57.05,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You think I'm weak, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.86,0:17:58.55,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.80,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,First come at me as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.97,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,And I'll carve this into your memory:
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.49,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,"The first person I met \Nwho was stronger than me
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.49,0:18:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was a pervert with a \Nthing for dirty jokes."
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.56,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.29,0:18:15.35,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Let's see the power that got you into
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.35,0:18:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the special forces squad \Non your first day!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.94,0:18:21.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.87,0:18:24.70,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.24,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,This stops him.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.32,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.32,0:18:38.29,Dialogue,O,0,0,0,,He was able to see through Gear's speed?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.99,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You weren't running with \Nyour best technique.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.99,0:18:47.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Maybe it feels good to run as \Nfast as you can like that,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.73,0:18:51.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,but that only works on the first stage.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.46,0:18:54.55,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,If you want to survive, \Ncast aside those feelings.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.75,0:19:00.11,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Fighting on a battlefield \Nmeans killing.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.11,0:19:02.62,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You can't fight a real battle \Nbased off how you feel.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.37,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.31,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I completely lost.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.28,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Til.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.21,0:19:16.13,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Am I really unworthy of your respect?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.77,0:19:19.51,Italics,G,0,0,0,,No, I made a promise!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.17,0:19:23.27,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Nobody starts at the goal.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.45,Italics,G,0,0,0,,I swore to run to the goal!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.19,Italics,G,0,0,0,,No matter how many times \NI go down on the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.84,0:19:40.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Are you okay, brother?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.48,0:19:41.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.78,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.61,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,How did you enjoy your first beating?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.03,0:19:51.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sure, you're strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.53,0:19:55.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,But there are a lot of people on \Nthe battlefield who are stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.62,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I'd imagine you'll meet a few \Nof them during the operation.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.50,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to go anyway, new kid?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.09,0:20:05.99,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Or will you give up and \Ngo back to training?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.99,0:20:06.81,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.44,0:20:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.24,0:20:10.26,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.41,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I decided I'd go straight ahead!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.10,0:20:15.98,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,No hesitation.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.61,0:20:17.57,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.91,0:20:20.00,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,For your dead friend?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.63,0:20:21.82,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.86,0:20:23.81,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Was I right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.39,0:20:26.83,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Well, it was the only \Nlogical deduction.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.30,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I figured something like that was
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.30,0:20:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the only way to get a \Ncoward to come down from
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the mountain he was hiding on.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.24,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You're trying to go straight forward,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to make up for all the time \Nyou spent at a standstill?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.35,0:20:39.51,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Pretty simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.59,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,No matter what you say,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to follow my own path!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.52,0:20:47.21,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,No, I'm not saying it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.21,0:20:48.39,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I think it's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.88,0:20:51.89,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I think there's nothing \Nwrong with your answer.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.80,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I don't like people who aren't \Nstraight with others.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.40,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You should go as deep \Nas you can with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.48,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,A stick...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.33,0:21:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,doesn't feel good unless \Nyou stick it straight in.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.30,0:21:05.57,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Go straight ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.17,0:21:09.02,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I hope you find your real answer there.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.34,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Tejirof, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.42,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I had the wrong idea about you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.79,0:21:20.61,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I want to be stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.67,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,So help me train!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.47,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.94,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,But rest a bit more today.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.94,0:21:30.18,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,You can read these \Nwhile you're resting.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:31.84,0:21:32.93,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.34,0:21:36.94,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,The map of Hope Fortress, \Nwhere we're headed.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.33,0:21:41.19,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,It was close to the port, \Nso I took a look before I came here.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.55,0:21:45.17,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,I got a little too into it and so \NI was an hour late in arriving,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.45,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,but well, nobody told \Nme to look for it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.74,0:21:51.95,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,So this was me pleasuring myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.39,0:21:54.46,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.96,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Nel, the world's a big place.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.51,0:22:04.10,Italics,G,0,0,0,,Til, I'm going to keep running!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.29,0:23:28.74,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,That was the incident known \Nas the Atarika Shock.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.84,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,"Shooting."
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.80,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,No, I can't hold it in anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.55,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,You seem to have a knack for Online.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.55,0:23:35.14,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Like how that girl's nice...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.82,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,I want to be strong anyway!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.82,0:23:39.94,Dialogue,Preview,0,0,0,,Is that why this operation is so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:42.89,Title,,0,0,0,,
